# Two classes without a constructor of their own pass their arguments on by place, so the fields of Base are typed by what stands at each place. The one caller that leaves the second place empty stands behind a static of Base and is found late, through both classes: if the fall of the fewest were lost on the way, the last line would read a text out of a slot that holds `undefined`.
